---
description: Require English for code, comments, docs, and commit messages
alwaysApply: true
---

# Language: English

All project artifacts must be written in English.

- Source code identifiers (variables, functions, classes, files)
- Comments and docstrings
- Documentation (README, rules, guides)
- Commit messages and pull request descriptions
- Error messages and user-facing strings unless a locale/i18n layer intentionally provides translations

```text
# ❌ BAD
# Ajoute un utilisateur à la base

# ✅ GOOD
# Add a user to the database
```

When the user writes in another language, reply in that language if helpful, but keep **code and committed docs in English**.
